# diffusers 0.32.0, transformers 4.51.3, accelerate 1.0.0, safetensors 0.6.2, sentencepiece 0.2.0, einops 0.8.1).
# Training-only packages (deepspeed, bitsandbytes, xformers, came_pytorch, prodigyopt, torchao, polars) are left out:
# experiments/eval_libero.py and the modules it imports reach them only inside optimizer / attention fallbacks.
